emes, state machines, and embedded assets into a single compressed file.","🦀 Rust + WASM core — powered by dotlottie-rs, the same engine that ships in iOS, Android, and native dotLottie players. One battle-tested implementation across every platform.","🎨 ThorVG renderer — an industrial-grade vector graphics engine with the broadest Lottie feature coverage of any web renderer. See the ThorVG Lottie support matrix.","⚡ Three rendering backends — Software (Canvas2D), WebGL2, and WebGPU (experimental). Switch with a one-line import change — same DotLottie class everywhere.","📁 dotLottie v2 ready — first-class theming, interactive state machines, and audio in a single .lottie file. No userland wiring required."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LottieFiles/dotlottie-web/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e7d69a113aca3d59655d4f085e6c790f1ff9c5cc87077176a9eabd9b1c9ab0c3","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:00:22.490Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T16:00:49.426Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T16:31:55Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The official LottieFiles player for Lottie (.json) and dotLottie (.lottie) animations on the web — a Rust + WASM core powered by ThorVG, with Software, WebGL2, and WebGPU rendering backends and full dotLottie v2 support (theming, state machines, and audio).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LottieFiles/dotlottie-web/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e7d69a113aca3d59655d4f085e6c790f1ff9c5cc87077176a9eabd9b1c9ab0c3","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LottieFiles/dotlottie-web/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T16:00:49.427Z"},"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:17.645Z","latestRelease":{"name":"@lottiefiles/dotlottie-web@0.80.0","tag":"@lottiefiles/dotlottie-web@0.80.0","publishedAt":"2026-08-28T07:36:29Z","url":"https://github.com/LottieFiles/dotlottie-web/releases/tag/%40lottiefiles/dotlottie-web%400.80.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:17.645Z","screenshots":[],"demoHeal